        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Sizemore, Wesley Snipes, Bruce Payne, Richard Nord\n- Films: Born on the Fourth of July, Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man, Passenger 57, True Romance, Natural Born Killers, Strange Days, Heat, Saving Private Ryan, Red Planet, Black Hawk Down, Pearl Harbor, The Fugitive\n- Video Games: Grand Theft Auto: Vice City\n- Roles: Sonny Forelli\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Sizemore is known for supporting roles in the films Born on the Fourth of July (1989) and Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man (1991).\n- Passenger 57 (1992) stars Wesley Snipes and Bruce Payne.\n- Tom Sizemore is known for supporting roles in the films Passenger 57 (1992) and True Romance (1993).\n- Tom Sizemore is known for supporting roles in the films Natural Born Killers (1994), Strange Days (1995), and Heat (1995).\n- Tom Sizemore is known for supporting roles in Saving Private Ryan (1998), Red Planet (2000), Black Hawk Down (2001), and Pearl Harbor (2001).\n- Richard Nord is a film editor best known for The Fugitive and Passenger 57.\n- Tom Sizemore voiced Sonny Forelli in the video game Grand Theft Auto: Vice City.",
